[[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Release the clips (1a) and remove the handle gaiter (1b) from\nthe lower seat on the dashboard.</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Protect the contact areas between\nthe knob and the tool with felt, bodywork tape, etc. to prevent superficial\ndamage.</p></aside><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2034743.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[3,63,0,"<p>1. Position the tool (1c) as illustrated in the figure and undo\nthe bolt until the knob (1a) is completely removed from the lever\n(1b).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1c</p></td><td><p>Extractor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.870.668.000</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2034744.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[3,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>1. Position the tool (1c) as illustrated in the figure and act on\nthe bolt until the knob (2a) is fully fitted on the lever (2b).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1c</p></td><td><p>Extractor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.870.668.000</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2034745.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[3,63,0,"<p>Position the boot and secure the fastening\nsprings.</p>"]]